<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>游戏攻略主页</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "微软雅黑", sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .game-box {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 45px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ffd700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            font-size: 38px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
        }
        .module {
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .module:hover {
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border-color: rgba(255, 149, 0, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 149, 0, 0.15);
        }
        h2 {
            color: #ff9500;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            font-size: 24px;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff9500;
            padding-left: 12px;
        }
        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        li {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            line-height: 2.2;
            font-size: 17px;
            padding-left: 16px;
            position: relative;
        }
        li::before {
            content: "•";
            color: #ff9500;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }
        /* 移动端适配 */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .game-box {
                padding: 25px;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="game-box">
        <h1>热门游戏攻略站</h1>
        <div class="module">
            <h2>角色强度排行</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>T0 版本核心角色：输出天花板，必练推荐</li>
                <li>T1 强势角色：开荒舒适，通用性极强</li>
                <li>T2 特色角色：特定体系发挥稳定</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="module">
            <h2>新手开荒指南</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>前期优先培养核心输出角色</li>
                <li>合理分配体力，避免资源浪费</li>
                <li>优先推进主线，解锁更多玩法</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="module">
            <h2>玩法技巧</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>技能释放顺序决定输出上限</li>
                <li>阵容搭配优先保证属性互补</li>
                <li>隐藏关卡解锁条件一览</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
